        "inject an enabled record for `builtin:live` before building the view: `buildUnifiedChannels` hides",
        "every member whose playlist record is missing or disabled, so without the injection this case returns",
        "zero rows instead of the three the user sees today. `absent-document` proves the same thing through",
        "the null path; this one proves it through a real document with nothing in it."
